<h3 id=3D"complexity-analysis">Complexity Analysis</h3>
<p><strong>Time complexity:</strong> The time complexity of the <code>repea=
ted_removal_of_adjacent_duplicates</code> function is <span class=3D"katex"=
><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/Ma=
