lass=3D"mord mathnormal">n</span></span></span></span> characters in the st=
ack. The stack <code>push</code> and <code>pop</code> operations contribute=
 <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://w=
